{"id":"chu","lemma":"чу","pos":"intj","rank":4351,"glosses":["listen!; be quiet! (interjection used to draw someone's attention to a sound or make someone listen to something)","I can hear"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8e/Ru-%D1%87%D1%83.ogg/Ru-%D1%87%D1%83.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я обычно не пла́чу.","en":"I don't usually cry.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"usually"},{"g":"not"},null,null]},{"text":"Я, наверное, запла́чу.","en":"I think I'll cry.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"probably, most likely"},null,null]},{"text":"Я до сих пор иногда пла́чу.","en":"I still sometimes cry.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,null,{"g":"sometimes, at times"},null,null],"phrases":[[1,4,"still"]]},{"text":"Том знал, что я не запла́чу.","en":"Tom knew that I wouldn't cry.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},null,null]},{"text":"Том спросил меня, пла́чу ли я.","en":"Tom asked me if I cried.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to ask","l":"спросить"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null,null,{"g":"whether (question)"},{"g":"I"}]}]}